  67:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Vshield.c **** *
  68:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Vshield.c **** * \brief Sets the drive mode for each of the Pins component's pins.
  69:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Vshield.c **** * 
  70:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Vshield.c **** * <b>Note</b> This affects all pins in the Pins component instance. Use the
  71:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Vshield.c **** * Per-Pin APIs if you wish to control individual pin's drive modes.
